{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a bigger discount? Wishlist and follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1746209409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Dig Harder Deal Smarter...&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dig and Deal</strong> is a <strong>digging</strong> and <strong>trading</strong> simulator where you run your own shop by selling the treasures you uncover underground. <strong>Dig, explore, collect valuable items, and make deals with your customers to grow your fortune!</strong> Buy better tools, dig deeper, discover rarer loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/dig.png?t=1746209409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/dig.gif?t=1746209409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig the terrain, find valuable items, upgrade your equipment, and dig even deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/bargain.png?t=1746209409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/bargain.gif?t=1746209409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Negotiate prices</strong> with customers to get the <strong>best possible deals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/quest.png?t=1746209409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/quest.gif?t=1746209409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some customers will offer <strong>unique quests</strong> with <strong>special rewards.</strong> Complete them to earn extra cash and uncover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/shop.png?t=1746209409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/shop.gif?t=1746209409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate and upgrade your shop</strong> with furniture and props to improve its look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/extras/discord.png?t=1746209409\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650740?t=1746209409","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650740?t=1746209409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/0d7866ca5e55db6672fc706ae0b09642a33fea35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746209409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650740/0d7866ca5e55db6672fc706ae0b09642a33fea35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746209409","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3664350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want a bigger discount? Wishlist and follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha